@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Design - guided profiles and portable configuration
top to bottom direction
class profile_form {
  + document(data, base)
}
class guided_config {
  + defaults(config)
  + apply(config, data)
}
class profile_bundle {
  + export(ids, all)
  + documents(json)
  + import(json)
}
class profile_config {
  + __construct(config)
  + get_config()
}
class profiles {
  + load(profileid)
  + save(json, profileid)
}
profile_form --> guided_config
profile_form --> profile_config
profile_bundle --> profile_config
profile_bundle --> profiles
profiles --> profile_config
profile_form -[hidden]right-> profile_bundle
guided_config -[hidden]right-> profiles
note bottom of guided_config : Preserve rules without a guided control.
note bottom of profiles : Activate immutable revisions under a lock.
@enduml
